  "description": "Professional SDK for TAF Kibana logging and analytics platform. Version 1.2.5 fixes a cascade where bulk-log shipping silently failed with 400 (\"missing required property: UserId\") whenever BusContext.UserId was null (startup events, background workers) — sink saw the failure and buffered the whole batch to disk, even though Kibana was up. LogService.BuildSingleRequest now coalesces null identity Guids to Guid.Empty so the JSON always carries the required tenantId/applicationId/environmentId/userId fields. Version 1.2.4 replaced the hand-rolled retry loop with Polly retry + circuit-breaker policies and added a null-entries guard on WriteBulkAsync. Version 1.2.0 added working WriteAsync / WriteBulkAsync log shipping, fluent WriteLog / WriteLogs extensions, and tenant-aware BusContext validation.",
